                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami tokoleeni dira Gaza keesati inhafu, diri Ashkelonileeni ona taha. Worra Ashdodile guyya guddaani dira keesaa gussani, worra Ekronile dira isaani keesaa gussani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaargala keesani, gosa Kerethi, ta afaani baariini teetu. AABBO Waaqi ya wollaala isaniti mure, isani worra Filisti. Inni isani balleesa, isani tokoleeni inhaftani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti teesani ta d'aatu baariini jirtu marra dansa baafte mana tissitutiifi moona hooliye achiti jaarani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEP 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Yuda ka hafe d'ufe lafa teesani fud'ate, ree ufii achiti tiffate mana dira Ashkeloni keesa rafa. Wonti akanatiifi AABBO Waaqi isaani akuma duri kaani horsisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEP.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEP.2.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
